OL,3,GNEWSAVapes seized in schools spiked
OL,4,Awith drugs, Met says
OL,5,
OL,6,FDeputy Assistant Commissioner Ben
OL,7,FRussell said the initial findings were
OL,8,F"surprisingly high" and highlighted the
OL,9,Frisks to children who may believe they
OL,10,Fare inhaling ordinary nicotine
OL,11,Fproducts.
